    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TICKDOWN</strong> is a fast-paced elemental FPS that blends together Arena FPS and Bullet Hell gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a counter-terrorist agent. You have two real-time hours to locate and defuse a weapon of mass destruction. Use the powers of Water, Earth, Fire, and Air to fight your way through hordes of enemies to reach your objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a fluid movement system to soar above your enemies, raining down destructive abilities from the air. At the same time, <i>you heal yourself by taking damage</i>. Balance movement and <strong>embracing the bullet hell</strong> to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have access to <strong>6 elemental abilities</strong>, with <strong>4 unique attacks</strong> for each ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/83a41fd7e2141071220bb2aa9b7768f0.poster.avif?t=1729645060\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/83a41fd7e2141071220bb2aa9b7768f0.webm?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/83a41fd7e2141071220bb2aa9b7768f0.mp4?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine your abilities together to form even more destructive ones:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a Whirlpool, freeze it into an Ice Storm, electrify the Ice Storm into a Lightning Storm, and then blow up the Lightning Storm to release a long range Shockwave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a Black Hole by electrifying an enemy's imploding corpse, and then dunk a Lightning Basketball into the Black Hole to trap enemies in a shatterable alternate dimension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Concentrate Air Pressure into a bubble that traps enemies and projectiles inside. Blow up the Pressure Bubble to Microwave all enemies trapped inside<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/8c2502e18c72b369e512fea37e0bb60f.poster.avif?t=1729645060\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/8c2502e18c72b369e512fea37e0bb60f.webm?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/8c2502e18c72b369e512fea37e0bb60f.mp4?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots more combinations you can find through experimentation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, you can hijack enemy attacks to create even more unique abilities, such as lobbing up a Lightning Basketball to an enemy as they're performing a ground smash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/a1f7fe46a2323adc18f11f1cae975c70.poster.avif?t=1729645060\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/a1f7fe46a2323adc18f11f1cae975c70.webm?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/a1f7fe46a2323adc18f11f1cae975c70.mp4?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TICKDOWN</strong> has a unique multi-layered story set in a world where the entirety of Planet Earth got Isekai'd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no hard time limit for beating the game (the story doesn't end just because you failed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also secrets, lore books, and optional challenge fights for you to find through exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photosensitive content warning</strong>: TICKDOWN may not be suitable for those who may experience seizures when exposed to certain or intense visuals</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TICKDOWN</strong> is a fast-paced elemental FPS that blends together Arena FPS and Bullet Hell gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a counter-terrorist agent. You have two real-time hours to locate and defuse a weapon of mass destruction. Use the powers of Water, Earth, Fire, and Air to fight your way through hordes of enemies to reach your objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a fluid movement system to soar above your enemies, raining down destructive abilities from the air. At the same time, <i>you heal yourself by taking damage</i>. Balance movement and <strong>embracing the bullet hell</strong> to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have access to <strong>6 elemental abilities</strong>, with <strong>4 unique attacks</strong> for each ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/83a41fd7e2141071220bb2aa9b7768f0.poster.avif?t=1729645060\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/83a41fd7e2141071220bb2aa9b7768f0.webm?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/83a41fd7e2141071220bb2aa9b7768f0.mp4?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine your abilities together to form even more destructive ones:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a Whirlpool, freeze it into an Ice Storm, electrify the Ice Storm into a Lightning Storm, and then blow up the Lightning Storm to release a long range Shockwave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a Black Hole by electrifying an enemy's imploding corpse, and then dunk a Lightning Basketball into the Black Hole to trap enemies in a shatterable alternate dimension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Concentrate Air Pressure into a bubble that traps enemies and projectiles inside. Blow up the Pressure Bubble to Microwave all enemies trapped inside<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/8c2502e18c72b369e512fea37e0bb60f.poster.avif?t=1729645060\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/8c2502e18c72b369e512fea37e0bb60f.webm?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/8c2502e18c72b369e512fea37e0bb60f.mp4?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots more combinations you can find through experimentation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, you can hijack enemy attacks to create even more unique abilities, such as lobbing up a Lightning Basketball to an enemy as they're performing a ground smash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/a1f7fe46a2323adc18f11f1cae975c70.poster.avif?t=1729645060\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/a1f7fe46a2323adc18f11f1cae975c70.webm?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180180/extras/a1f7fe46a2323adc18f11f1cae975c70.mp4?t=1729645060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TICKDOWN</strong> has a unique multi-layered story set in a world where the entirety of Planet Earth got Isekai'd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no hard time limit for beating the game (the story doesn't end just because you failed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also secrets, lore books, and optional challenge fights for you to find through exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photosensitive content warning</strong>: TICKDOWN may not be suitable for those who may experience seizures when exposed to certain or intense visuals</p>",
